  "aboutTagline": "A free, dual-pane desktop file manager inspired by Total Commander and Midnight Commander",
  "aboutDescription": "Built for Windows, macOS, and Linux, it aims to be a classic file manager with fast keyboard-driven navigation, SMB/FTP/SFTP/WebDAV network drives, built-in viewers, and folder comparison and sync.",
  "aboutFeatureNavigation": "Dual-pane navigation, mouse and keyboard multi-select, pattern-based selection",
  "aboutFeatureFileOps": "Copy, move, delete, and compress with progress and conflict handling (skip/overwrite/rename)",
  "aboutFeatureNetwork": "SMB, FTP, SFTP, and WebDAV network drives (passwords are never stored)",
  "aboutFeatureViewer": "Built-in text, image, PDF, audio, and video viewers, plus browsing zip contents without extracting",
  "aboutFeatureSync": "Folder comparison with one-way and two-way sync",
  "aboutFeatureLocaleTheme": "Korean and English localization, light and dark themes",

